{"content":[{"c":["SILK"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Fine, delicate thread extracted from the cocoon of the silkworm. Originating in China, silk may have been introduced into Palestine as early as Solomon’s reign (970–930 ",{"c":["BC"],"sourceClass":"era","t":"span"},"), or perhaps not until the conquests of Alexander the Great (336–323 ",{"c":["BC"],"sourceClass":"era","t":"span"},"). A fine silken fabric was apparently included in the fashionable attire of Jerusalem (",{"href":"?bref=Ezek.16.10-13","r":"Ezek.16.10-13","rawR":"Ezek.16.10-13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezek.16.10-13","value":"Ezek.16.10-13"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ez 16:10-13"},"). ",{"href":"?bref=Rev.18.12","r":"Rev.18.12","rawR":"Rev.18.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Rev.18.12","value":"Rev.18.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"Revelation 18:12"}," lists silk as a valuable trade commodity of Babylon (Rome)."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=ClothandClothManufacturing_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"ClothandClothManufacturing_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"ClothandClothManufacturing_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Cloth and Cloth Manufacturing"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Silk","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Ez 16:10-13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezek.16.10-13","rawQueryValue":"Ezek.16.10-13","sourceRefExact":"Ezek.16.10-13"},{"anchorText":"Revelation 18:12","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Rev.18.12","rawQueryValue":"Rev.18.12","sourceRefExact":"Rev.18.12"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"aeb6ad53823fb48705ea20c663db4e913eb19fec664b84a46f51fae8e90e2908","sourceItemName":"Silk","sourceItemOrder":414,"sourceMember":"Articles/S.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Silk","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Silk","title":"Silk","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}